{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23402","headline":"问秋光 · 白居易","name":"问秋光","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殷卿领北镇，崔尹开南幕。\n外事信爲荣，中怀未必乐。\n何如不才者，兀兀无所作。\n不引窗下琴，即举池上酌。\n淡交唯对水，老伴无如鹤。\n自适颇从容，旁观诚濩落。\n身心转恬泰，烟景弥淡泊。\n回首语秋光，东来应不错。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}